      "side": 1,
      "message": "This change would be better if you restricted the implementation to the pi3usb9201 driver only.\n\nSomething like:\ncompatible: \"pericom,pi3usb9201\"\n\nproperties:\n  port:\n    type: phandle\n\n  i2c-addr-flags:\n  type: string\n  enum:\n      - \"PI3USB9201_I2C_ADDR_0_FLAGS\"\n      - \"PI3USB9201_I2C_ADDR_1_FLAGS\"\n      - \"PI3USB9201_I2C_ADDR_2_FLAGS\"\n      - \"PI3USB9201_I2C_ADDR_3_FLAGS\"\n      \n Then initailize the pi3usb9201_bc12_chips[] array based on device tree info.",
      "revId": "f5fa9f4fe7e1239bfbc9afd834854d4b403e3a42",
